ock_id":"cSpO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d78ff6a6-fc27-45e3-8c6f-99ff1ea769c1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/nl/articles/2104/16/news014.html|https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/nl/articles/2104/16/news014.html\u003e\n買いたくなってきた","ts":"1619080683.021000","attachments":[{"fallback":"ねとらぼ: 【体験レポ】『ポケモンスナップ』に20年囚われた男が『New ポケモンスナップ』を先行プレイしたら何も信じられなくなった話","id":1,"title":"【体験レポ】『ポケモンスナップ』に20年囚われた男が『New ポケモンスナップ』を先行プレイしたら何も信じられなくなった話","title_link":"https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/nl/articles/2104/16/news014.html","text":"理想の新作でした。","image_url":"https://image.itmedia.co.jp/nl/articles/2104/16/cover_news014.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"ねとらぼ","service_icon":"https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/nl/articles/2104/16/news014.html","original_url":"https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/nl/articles/2104/16/news014.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bBa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddf4323f-c6fd-4df5-a2f4-93d1c6f58b19","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"テイルズシリーズ、このまま新作出ないんじゃないかなって思ってた","ts":"1619070804.020900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qylgf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8DFE3BB9-12AA-490D-9DAA-628318980107","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"マルスの剣の先端間合いを管理するとかめちゃくちゃむずい","ts":"1619068120.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eoy6M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CAE12E55-CCBB-4928-B698-BD6DF4D805AD","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"スマブラ、ゲームスピードが速いんで間合い管理とかあんまりないんですよね（近距離とか遠距離みたいなのはあるけど）","ts":"1619068102.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ufh91"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7914a135-265f-46ac-b542-804d25f9e79e","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"格ゲーはけっこうやり込んでましたね\nただスマブラはガチの初心者なので、今よちよち歩きしな